Firstmate fork amendments
=========================

Upstream documentation (docs/, README.md, AGENTS.md, skills) is kept
byte-identical to upstream and is never rewritten for this fork. Where this
fork behaves differently from what an upstream document says, the difference
is recorded here, per upstream document and section. Read this file before
trusting an upstream doc. The file has no extension on purpose (see
fork/README): upstream's documentation-audience check refuses unregistered
*.md, *.mdx, *.rst, and *.txt files.

Each entry names the upstream document and section, then what this fork does
instead. Add an entry when a deviation is created; remove it when the fork
catches up. Hook-block edits are not listed here - fork/README "The hook
points" owns those.


